msgstr "✅ 您的订单已成功发货"

#: handlers/users/order.py:33
msgid ""
"😕 Kechirasiz xurmatli foydalanuvchi. Bizning ish vaqtimiz 11:00 dan 23:00"
" gacha bolganligi sababli siz hozir buyurtma bera olmaysiz!"
msgstr "😕 对不起，尊敬的用户。我们的营业时间是从11:00到23:00，所以您现在无法下单！"

#: handlers/users/order.py:46
msgid "‼️ Iltimos ushbu kartaga pul o'tkazing, va to'lov chekini yuboring.‼️"
msgstr "‼️ 请将款项转入此卡，并发送付款凭证。‼️"

